      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "GAL",
          "chapter": 5,
          "verse": 7
        }
      ],
      "en": "You were running well! Who interfered with you that you should not obey the truth?",
      "ko": "너희가 달음질을 잘 하더니 누가 너희를 막아 진리를 순종치 않게 하더냐",
      "source_text_hash": "2246d6316baace0441b790fdd22fb743f7a1636a1162e1b650d15342ade0d3f0",
      "translation_text_hash": "2984cd9c1dbf1d7dfbd430d260fc42974089fa02efdf5d461764f1716291c778",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "너희가 달음질을 잘 하더니 누가 너희를 막아 진리를 순종치 않게 하더냐"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "2984cd9c1dbf1d7dfbd430d260fc42974089fa02efdf5d461764f1716291c778"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:GAL:5:8",
      "sequence": 29167,
      "chapter_label": "GAL 5",
      "verse_label": "8",
      "locator": {
